      font-size="16px" font-weight="bold">PC 05.127  Nine Main Oval End Pear</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="248">Robert W. Strickland  10 June 2016</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="266">Easy cutting sequence</text>
